# Effects11 volumetric rays and sun rays on D3D11 (0) or ORG (1): Whiterun at 16:00 in clear weather, the player looking up
# towards the western sky at three headings (one of them faces the sun), a shot at each. Needs Effects11 active with a preset
# whose [EFFECT] has EnableVolumetricRays and EnableSunRays on.
CS_ORG_E11_RAYS=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 16;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;2000:fw 81a;2100:player.setangle x -20;2101:player.setangle z 200;2400:dclf:shot=sun-200;2500:player.setangle z 240;2800:dclf:shot=sun-240;2900:player.setangle z 280;3200:dclf:shot=sun-280
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3300
